{
  "title": "ISic001281. Funerary inscription",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">[Θε]οις</span>  <span data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">χθο[νίοις]</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\"><span data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">Ἀγαθη</span></span></span>  <span data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">χ[αῖρε]</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">[ἔ]ζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">[ἔτη</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">Θεοις</span>  <span data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">χθονίοις</span>  <span data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">Ἀγαθη</span>  <span data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">χαῖρε</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ἔζησεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ἔτη</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alessandra Rocchetti</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">[..]ΟΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">ΧΘΟ[.....]</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\"><span data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">ΑΓΑΘΗ</span></span></span><span data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">Χ[....]</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">[.]ΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">[...</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Θεοις\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Θεός\">ΘΕΟΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"χθονίοις\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"χθόνιος\">ΧΘΟΝΙΟΙΣ</span><span data-text=\"Ἀγαθη\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Ἀγαθή\">ΑΓΑΘΗ</span><span data-text=\"χαῖρε\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"χαίρω\">ΧΑΙΡΕ</span><span data-text=\"ἔζησεν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΕΖΗΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"ἔτος\">ΕΤΗ</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><p>  <span class=\"line 1\">line.1: <span>[Θε]οῖς Χθο[νίοις] Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c); Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457)</span></span><br>  <span class=\"line 2\">line.2: <span>Ἀγάθη χ[αῖρε] Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457); ἡ δεῖνα ἀ]γάθη Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c)</span></span><br>  <span class=\"line 3\">line.3: <span>[ἔ]ζησεν [ἔτη ---] Franz (ap. CIG III 5732c); Kaibel (ap. IG XIV 457)</span></span>  </p></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>To the Gods of the Underworld. Agathe, farewell! She lived for … years.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>This epitaph is dedicated to a deceased female, Agathe, and preceeded by an invocation to the Gods of the Underworld, in a less usual form than the more typical <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Θεοῖς Καταχθονίοις</span> (cf. IG XIV 30 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000847\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000847</a>, IG XIV 49 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000866\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000866</a>, both from Siracusa). The unabbreviated form is found before the Augustan age, but occasionally also after: this seems to be the case, if at l. 2 we read the name Agathe (and not an adjective referred to the deceased, with the name in the lacuna, as Franz ap. CIG III 5732c). <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἀγάθη</span> is a name which recurs in Catania in several palaeochristian epitaphs: IG XIV 523 (= <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001343\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001343</a>), IG XIV 524 (= <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001334\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001344</a>), IG XIV 525 (= <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000964\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000964</a>), IG XIV 552 (<a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic001371\" target=\"_blank\">ISic001371</a>). The age, expressed in numerals, is lost in the final lacuna. </p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Franz 1853 5732c <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">457</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence </div>",
